      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "A major milestone this week in the Coast Guard’s drug interdiction efforts: Since January 20, we’ve seized over 242,000 pounds of cocaine. With as little as 1.2g being enough to kill someone, that’s 91 million potentially lethal doses.  \n\n@USCG continues to surge forces along the southern border and maritime approaches. The strategy is working. Applying our unique authorities and capabilities, we’ve stopped over 100% percent more cocaine than we did in 2024.\n\nBravo Zulu to the men and women of the Coast Guard. Through their tireless efforts – and close coordination with interagency partners – we are seizing record amounts of illegal drugs and making America safer. \n \nRead more: https://t.co/fW6ZUT4FOt\n\n#USCG #druginterdiction #ValueToNation @DHSgov",
      "text_resolved": "A major milestone this week in the Coast Guard’s drug interdiction efforts: Since January 20, we’ve seized over 242,000 pounds of cocaine. With as little as 1.2g being enough to kill someone, that’s 91 million potentially lethal doses.  \n\n@USCG continues to surge forces along the southern border and maritime approaches. The strategy is working. Applying our unique authorities and capabilities, we’ve stopped over 100% percent more cocaine than we did in 2024.\n\nBravo Zulu to the men and women of the Coast Guard. Through their tireless efforts – and close coordination with interagency partners – we are seizing record amounts of illegal drugs and making America safer. \n \nRead more: https://www.dhs.gov/news/2025/07/15/coast-guard-seizes-over-240000-pounds-cocaine-doubling-amount-interdicted-over\n\n#USCG #druginterdiction #ValueToNation @DHSgov",
