      "text": "Owning the maritime border, one interdiction at a time. Continuing @USCG efforts to control, secure, and defend our southern border, U.S. Coast Guard Maritime Safety and Security Team San Francisco- 91105 applied their full capabilities to complete a successful interdiction off Point Loma.\n\nAlways ready, the men and women of the Coast Guard remain on watch across our maritime borders and approaches, where defense of America begins.\n\n#USCG #FD2028 #EveryWarEveryShore \n@DHSgov \nhttps://t.co/p6XbyJsrDp",
