      "text": "When you have the finest maritime fighting force, you can trust your crews to make the most difficult decisions on the frontlines. Continuing the @USCG transformation through Force Design 2028, our updated use-of-force policy empowers tactical crews to act more quickly and decisively when stopping non-compliant vessels. \n \nCoast Guard operators are putting this authority to work already. Watch this video for an inside look at the new policy, or read more here: https://t.co/CmY5sP9ZaH\n\n@DHSgov \n#USCG #FD2028 #EveryWarEveryShore",
