      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "A vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation. That’s why members of Patrol Forces Southwest Asia, or PATFORSWA, work tirelessly to protect the American people. Their focus: pushing our borders outward and stopping threats at the source, far from American shores. Their approach: mobile, layered, and proactive, using cutting-edge technology and highly trained personnel to maintain a constant state of vigilance.\n\nWant to see how PATFORSWA stays sharp, focused and ready to protect the American people? Take a behind-the-scenes look at their mission in action. #USCG #AlwaysReady #ValuetoNation \n@DHSgov",
